// DEFECT (silent no-op). An effect that reads a `Var` with no value does nothing; the act is
// reported lawful and valid and the payment disappears. Expected: an error that `paid` has no value.
Fact usd Identified by Money(USD, 2)
Var paid Identified by usd
Fact p Identified by A
Act pay Actor p Related to usd Holds when True Creates paid(paid.usd + usd).
pay(A, 500).
?!(Exists paid: paid).   // WRONG: five dollars were paid
